## Recommendations

- Prioritize Bulk user management as a top roadmap candidate because it combines customer demand with a priority score of 3.86.
- Use Now / Next / Later to protect the roadmap from ad-hoc requests while preserving visibility for valuable future opportunities.
- Connect high-severity, high-retention-risk feedback with Customer Success follow-up and product discovery.
- Treat high-impact/low-effort items as quick wins without allowing them to displace major strategic initiatives.
- Use customer segment and revenue filters so enterprise impact is visible without letting a single customer dominate prioritization.
- Close the feedback loop by communicating roadmap outcomes and tracking changes in CSAT, NPS, retention risk and request volume.
